# MUDAC agent routing

Use root `AGENTS.md` as shared bootstrap authority and `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` as the single reusable workflow source.

Use `docs/index.md` for unknown-location discovery and `python scripts/resolve_stable_id.py <ID>` for known stable IDs.

Do not treat generated `knowledge/`, numbered history, or quarantined Architecture/Implementation candidates as current semantic authority.

Do not auto-start adjacent work after completing the human-selected task. A3/A4 boundaries remain governed by `docs/canonical/governance/agentic-authority-scope.md`.
